<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.2 Main Restuls ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ MemGen: Weaving Generative Latent Memory for Self-Evolving Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">[For RQ2] <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">MemGen</span> Exhibits Strong Cross-Domain Generalization.</span></a></li>
